<LegalPage lang="en" page="privacy" title="Privacy policy" description="How RESUELVE INTELLECT processes personal data under the GDPR." updated="17/11/2026">
  <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
  <Owner lang="en" />
  <h2>2. Data we process</h2>
  <p>The data you provide in the assessment form: name, company, email, phone (optional), country, industry, number of employees, service of interest and the description of your need. If you used them, we also attach your savings calculator result, the demos you tried and the campaign (UTM) parameters of your visit, to better understand your case.</p>
  <p>We do not store your IP address in the contacts database. It is used transiently only to limit abusive submissions.</p>
  <h2>3. Purposes and legal basis</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Handling your request and preparing the assessment</strong> — legal basis: your consent and pre-contractual steps taken at your request (Art. 6(1)(a) and 6(1)(b) GDPR).</li>
    <li><strong>Commercial follow-up of your request</strong> — same legal basis; only in relation to what you asked for.</li>
    <li><strong>Sending you news about AI and automation</strong> — only if you tick the corresponding box (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR). You may withdraw consent at any time.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>4. Interactive demos</h2>
  <p>Demos in "Simulation" mode run entirely in your browser: no data is sent or stored. If the receptionist demo runs in "Live AI" mode, the messages you type are sent to an AI model provider to generate the reply and are not stored in our systems. Do not enter personal or health data in the demos.</p>
  <h2>5. Recipients and processors</h2>
  <p>We do not share your data with third parties unless legally required. To provide the service we use providers acting as processors, with the safeguards required by the GDPR (including, where applicable, standard contractual clauses for international transfers):</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Web hosting and request storage (Netlify).</li>
    <li>Workflow automation (Make) and, depending on configuration, spreadsheet (Google Sheets), email (Gmail), sales CRM and WhatsApp Business.</li>
    <li>AI provider for the live demo, if enabled.</li>
    <li>Anti-spam verification (Cloudflare Turnstile), if enabled.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>6. Retention</h2>
  <p>We keep data for as long as needed to handle your request and, at most, 24 months from the last contact if no business relationship begins, unless legally required otherwise. Newsletter data is kept until you withdraw consent.</p>
  <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
  <p>You may exercise your rights of access, rectification, erasure, objection, restriction and portability, and withdraw consent, by writing to the email in section 1. You may also lodge a complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Agency (<a href="https://www.aepd.es" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">www.aepd.es</a>) or your local supervisory authority.</p>
  <h2>8. Security</h2>
  <p>We apply appropriate technical and organisational measures: encrypted connections (HTTPS), credential-restricted access, third-party service keys stored only on the server and signed submissions to the CRM.</p>
</LegalPage>
